{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Arial;}}\paperw11906\paperh16838\margl1134\margr1134\margt1134\margb1134\f0\fs22\pard\sa240\fs36\b RecipeNest Startup Guide\b0\fs22\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 Recipe discovery and meal planning website using AngularJS 1.8.2. This guide covers local startup, assumptions, dependencies, architecture and resetting saved data.\par\pard\keepn\sb180\sa80\b Prerequisites\b0\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 Use Windows, Node.js 18 or later OR Python 3, and a modern browser. No npm install or Internet connection is needed for the supplied ZIP. All images and framework scripts are local.\par\pard\keepn\sb180\sa80\b Startup\b0\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 1. Extract the whole ZIP and keep every subfolder.\line 2. Double-click START-WINDOWS.bat, or run node server.js from this folder.\line 3. Open http://127.0.0.1:4175 in the browser.\line 4. Keep the server window open. Press Ctrl+C to stop.\line Alternative: python -m http.server 4175 --bind 127.0.0.1\line Do not open index.html through file://; templates and JSON require HTTP.\par\pard\keepn\sb180\sa80\b Scope and assumptions\b0\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 This is a front-end educational application. No login, backend database, real transactions or email delivery. Recipes, dietary tags and declared allergens are sample data, and profiles are fictional. Images are illustrative and may differ from the exact dish. The planner is a Monday-Sunday sample week, with breakfast, lunch and dinner slots.\par\pard\keepn\sb180\sa80\b Calculator\b0\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 Enter a whole number of servings from 1 to 20. New amount = original amount x requested servings / base servings, rounded to two decimals. Units stay unchanged. To-taste ingredients do not scale. Preparation time does not scale. Fractional counts of whole ingredients are mathematical estimates.\par\pard\keepn\sb180\sa80\b Module controllers and services\b0\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 recipeNest depends on ngRoute. Catalogue loads JSON and retains catalogue filters. SavedData shares and persists favourites and the meal plan; BrowserStorage delegates to Local Storage. Controllers manage each screen. recipeCard shares a card template, while modalKeys supports accessible preview/editor controls. js/logic.js contains pure validation, calculation, filtering and restore functions.\par\pard\keepn\sb180\sa80\b Persistence and reset\b0\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 Only recipe IDs and serving counts are saved in this browser. Removing a favourite does not remove its planned meals. If storage fails, a warning appears and changes continue in memory. To reset, delete recipenest.favourites.v1 and recipenest.plan.v1 in browser DevTools under Application or Storage, then reload. Contact messages are neither sent nor saved.\par\pard\keepn\sb180\sa80\b Dependencies and credits\b0\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 AngularJS and angular-route 1.8.2 are bundled from code.angularjs.org under MIT; see assets/vendor/ANGULAR-LICENSE.txt. Food images: Unsplash; original URLs and acknowledgements are in assets/CREDITS.md. Interface and favicon are original project assets. Node.js is used only for an optional static server and tests.\par\pard\keepn\sb180\sa80\b Testing and project report\b0\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 Run npm test: 33 automated tests pass with Node.js 24.19.0. Open docs/PROJECT-REPORT.html for requirements, algorithms, flowcharts, test cases and screenshots. Read docs/TEST-RESULTS.md for actual browser checks and remaining verification. A second independent desktop browser and real mobile device still need confirmation before formal submission. docs/DEMO-GUIDE.md contains a video recording script; no demo video is included.\par\pard\keepn\sb180\sa80\b Vietnamese instructions\b0\par\pard\sa140\sl280\slmult1 See README.md in the root folder for the complete Vietnamese guide. This ReadMe.doc contains RTF content readable by Microsoft Word. It is not a binary Word 97 document.\par}